        "acid"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature critically hits a mutant wolf while adjacent to it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The wound causes gore to spray from a ruptured pustule. The triggering creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> acid damage (DC 19 basic Reflex save). This occurs even if the attack kills the wolf.</p>",
